claude|csbm|claude-sonnet-5-5[1m]|max|sub+safe
claude|csbu|claude-sonnet-5-5[1m]|ultracode|sub+safe
claude|csbx|claude-sonnet-5-5[1m]|xhigh|sub+safe
claude|csbh|claude-sonnet-5-5[1m]|high|sub+safe
claude|csbmm|claude-sonnet-5-5[1m]|medium|sub+safe
claude|chm|claude-haiku-5-5[1m]|max|sub
